      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Floating toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is hidden by default and only appears when needed. In this mode there are actually two different toolbars:__TRILIUM_PH_2____TRILIUM_PH_3____TRILIUM_PH_4__",
