    {
      "id": "u_20cc515fa33496d1ef4e87ba_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For readability purposes on wider screens, the width of text notes is limited via a configurable option. See __TRILIUM_PH_0__Content width__TRILIUM_PH_1__ for more information.",
